      "ScriptKr": "1;수영복 불량배 MG;00\n5;수영복 불량배 SMG;05;크, 크윽-!\n#1;a\n#5;a\n#5;stiff\n#5;em;[땀]",
      "TextJp": "ぐうっ！",
      "TextCn": "唔！",
      "TextTh": "อะ...อึ่ก!",
      "TextTw": "唔！",
      "TextEn": "U-Ugh!",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10002025/lines/0006.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
