    {
      "GroupId": 10002025,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "[s] \"왜 그래, 츠루기?\"",
      "TextJp": "[s] \"ツルギ、どうしたの？\"",
      "TextCn": "[s]「鹤城，怎么了吗？」",
      "TextTh": "[s] \"เป็นอะไรเหรอซึรุกิ?\"",
      "TextTw": "[s]「弦生，怎麼了嗎？」",
      "TextEn": "[s] \"What's wrong, Tsurugi?\"",
      "VoiceJp": "",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": ""
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10002025,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "3;츠루기 수영복ND;04;이…… 이게 아닌데…….\n#3;stiff\n#3;em;[땀]",
      "TextJp": "こ、こんなはずでは……。",
      "TextCn": "不，不该是这样……",
      "TextTh": "ตะ... ต้องไม่ใช่แบบนี้สิ...",
      "TextTw": "不，不該是這樣……",
      "TextEn": "It wasn't supposed to be like this...",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10002025/lines/0021.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[anxious]こ、こんなはずでは……。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10002025,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "3;츠루기 수영복ND;06;바다가…… 여름이……. 우정이……. \n#3;em;[속상함]",
      "TextJp": "海が、夏が、友情が……。",
      "TextCn": "大海、夏天、友情……",
      "TextTh": "ทะเล... ฤดูร้อน... มิตรภาพ... ",
      "TextTw": "大海、夏天、友情……",
      "TextEn": "The beach, summer, friendship... ",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10002025/lines/0022.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[sad]海が、夏が、友情が……。"
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10002025,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "[s] \"관광지를 어지럽히는 불량배들을 혼내주는 건 훌륭한 일이니까.\"",
      "TextJp": "[s] \"ツルギはそれを、ちゃんと守ってくれたんだよ。\"",
      "TextCn": "[s]「鹤城好好地守住了那些哦。」",
      "TextTh": "[s] \"การช่วยสั่งสอนนักเลงที่ก่อกวนสถานที่ท่องเที่ยวเป็นเรื่องที่สุดยอดเลยนะ\"",
      "TextTw": "[s]「弦生好好地守住了那些哦。」",
      "TextEn": "[s] \"You did a good job protecting us from those thugs.\"",
      "VoiceJp": "",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": ""
    },
    {
      "GroupId": 10002025,
      "SelectionGroup": 0,
      "BGMId": 0,
      "Sound": "",
      "Transition": 0,
      "BGName": 0,
      "BGEffect": 0,
      "PopupFileName": "",
      "ScriptKr": "3;츠루기 수영복ND;07;그, 그렇…… 습니까.\n#3;em;[///]\n#3;stiff",
      "TextJp": "あ、えっと…………は、はい。",
      "TextCn": "啊，那个……是，是。",
      "TextTh": "ยะ...อย่างนั้น...เหรอคะ",
      "TextTw": "啊，那個……是，是。",
      "TextEn": "I...did?",
      "VoiceJp": "https://r2.rikaaa0928.moe/ba-story-viewer/tts/event/10002025/lines/0024.mp3",
      "VoiceId": 0,
      "TeenMode": false,
      "TextJpVoice": "[embarrassed]あ、えっと…………は、はい。"
    },
